{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "港股打新预测 · i668 增强",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "description": "i668 港新工具箱增强：列表页追加四列——实时孖展倍数（招股期实时跳变，点列头可按倍数排序，用于多新股并行时挑最热的一只）、招股期 / 中签后 / 暗盘后三阶段预测；招股期预测已改为随实时孖展倍数实时联动（倍数越热，区间整体上移，口径与未标定边界均在界面写明）；详情页新增「预测工坊」，逐项展开计算过程、列出未纳入因子，并可手动改价覆盖模型。已发生的事实（暗盘收盘 / 首日收盘）只读不给预测。不改动站点原有列序与列宽，免费、纯前端，不上传任何数据。",
  "icons": {
    "16": "icons/icon-16.png",
    "48": "icons/icon-48.png",
    "128": "icons/icon-128.png"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "storage",
    "declarativeNetRequest"
  ],
  "declarative_net_request": {
    "rule_resources": [
      {
        "id": "hkex-cors",
        "enabled": true,
        "path": "rules/hkex-cors.json"
      }
    ]
  },
  "host_permissions": [
    "https://www.i668.vip/*",
    "https://qt.gtimg.cn/*",
    "https://web.ifzq.gtimg.cn/*",
    "https://www1.hkexnews.hk/*",
    "https://www.hkexnews.hk/*",
    "https://*.jsdelivr.net/*",
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/*",
    "https://gitee.com/*",
    "https://raw.giteeusercontent.com/*",
    "https://api.github.com/*",
    "https://www.valuable.com.hk/*",
    "https://www.vbkr.com/*",
    "https://lowrisktradesmart.org/*"
  ],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "background.js"
  },
  "web_accessible_resources": [
    {
      "resources": [
        "vendor/pdf.min.mjs",
        "vendor/pdf.worker.min.mjs",
        "vendor/cmaps/*"
      ],
      "matches": [
        "https://www.i668.vip/*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://www.i668.vip/stocks*"
      ],
      "js": [
        "data/extras.js",
        "data/ahclose.js",
        "content/core.js",
        "content/list.js",
        "content/detail.js",
        "content/boot.js"
      ],
      "css": [
        "content/styles.css"
      ],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "default_popup": "popup/popup.html",
    "default_title": "预测设置",
    "default_icon": {
      "16": "icons/icon-16.png",
      "48": "icons/icon-48.png",
      "128": "icons/icon-128.png"
    }
  }
}